*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0005
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-04-15 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-07 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 913
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP070
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0005.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCT-TYP           PIC X.
    *> TRANSACTIONS THIS MONTH
    05 MTH-TRAN-CNT       PIC 9(3).
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(6).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    05 EXTRA-TXN-FEE      PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM 3000-COUNT-FEE
    PERFORM 3100-BUS-SURCHG
    DISPLAY "EXTRA-TXN-FEE=" EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    STOP RUN.
3000-COUNT-FEE.
    *> EXCESS TRANSACTION FEE
    IF MTH-TRAN-CNT > 25
        COMPUTE EXTRA-TXN-FEE ROUNDED = (MTH-TRAN-CNT - 25) * 0.25
    END-IF.
3100-BUS-SURCHG.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'B' AND MTH-TRAN-CNT GREATER THAN 45
        ADD 15 TO EXTRA-TXN-FEE
    END-IF.
